d-snowball-execute\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Sky Piercer\",\"text\":\"Purchase Sky Piercer (1,500 gold) as item 3 in the Snowball Execute build for Aamon.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/aamon#build-snowball-execute\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Holy Crystal\",\"text\":\"Purchase Holy Crystal (3,000 gold) as item 4 in the Snowball Execute build for Aamon.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/aamon#build-snowball-execute\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Divine Glaive\",\"text\":\"Purchase Divine Glaive (1,970 gold) as item 5 in the Snowball Execute build for Aamon.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/aamon#build-snowball-execute\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Blood Wings\",\"text\":\"Purchase Blood Wings (2,100 gold) as item 6 in the Snowball Execute build for Aamon.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/aamon#build-snowball-execute\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/aamon\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-12T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-06T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}60:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n61:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":109,\"name\":\"Aamon\",\"slug\":\"aamon\",\"title\":\"Duke of Shards\",\"role\":[\"Assassin\"],\"specialty\":[\"Chase\",\"Magic Damage\"],\"lane\":[\"Jungle\"],\"tier\":\"B\",\"difficulty\":2,\"releaseYear\":2021,\"stats\":{\"durability\":30,\"offense\":70,\"controlEffect\":10,\"difficulty\":60},\"winRate\":50.13,\"pickRate\":0.59,\"banRate\":2.23,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"xavier\",\"heroName\":\"Xavier\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Squishy heroes with low mobility such as Layla and Hanabi.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"cecilion\",\"heroName\":\"Cecilion\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Squishy heroes with low mobility such as Layla and Hanabi.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"balmond\",\"heroName\":\"Balmond\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Tanky heroes or those that deal damage over time such as Balmond and Fredrinn.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"fredrinn\",\"heroName\":\"Fredrinn\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Tanky heroes or those that deal damage over time such as Balmond and Fredrinn.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_26b1c0ec95ad9e98f81b07d6838a8652.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b3a7602fe7ffd1e54bf8ea79ceadfa72.png\",\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Invisible Armor\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Each time Aamon hits an enemy with a skill, he enters Camouflage, becoming untargetable, recovering HP equal to 25 (+15% Total Magic Power) (+ 3% of his lost HP) every 0.5s, and gaining 80% Movement Speed that rapidly decays over 3s.\\n\\nUpon leaving the Camouflage state, Aamon immediately resets his Basic Attack's cooldown and enhances his Basic Attacks for 3s. Each enhanced Basic Attack deals 70 (+100% Total Physical Attack) (+115% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage. The first attack after manually leaving Camouflage instead deals 84 (+120% Total Physical Attack) (+138% Total Magic Power) damage and reduces all skill cooldowns by 1s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Each time Aamon hits an enemy with a skill, he enters \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Camouflage\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", becoming untargetable, recovering HP equal to 25\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+15% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+ 3% of his lost HP) every 0.5s, and gaining 80% Movement Speed that rapidly decays over 3s.\\n\\nUpon leaving the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Camouflage\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" state, Aamon immediately resets his Basic Attack's cooldown and enhances his Basic Attacks for 3s. Each enhanced Basic Attack deals 70\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+100% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"(+115% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage. The first attack after manually leaving \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Camouflage\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" instead deals 84\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+120% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"(+138% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" damage and reduces all skill cooldowns by 1s.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_96583b8721481fe151eceeb4d17f089c.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"Soul Shards\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Passive: Aamon charges his armor through enhanced Basic Attacks or while camouflaged. At 5 charges, Aamon throws 6 shards at the target on his next attack, each shard dealing 50 (+15% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage. The shards will then scatter around the target.\\n\\nActive: Aamon throws a shard at a nearby enemy, dealing 175 (+60% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Passive:\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Aamon charges his armor through enhanced Basic Attacks or while camouflaged. At 5 charges, Aamon throws 6 shards at the target on his next attack, each shard dealing 50\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+15% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage. The shards will then scatter around the target.\\n\\n\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Active:\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Aamon throws a shard at a nearby enemy, dealing 175\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+60% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"7s\",\"manaCost\":\"40\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_51b68183615922a3891919cd0a0d5536.png\",\"tags\":[\"Damage\",\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"Slayer Shards\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Aamon throws a shard forward, dealing 120 (+50% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and slowing enemies hit by 50% for 2s. The shard returns to Aamon after a short delay, granting him the Camouflage state.\\n\\nIf the shard hits a non-minion enemy, it returns immediately.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Aamon throws a shard forward, dealing 120\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+50% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage and slowing enemies hit by 50% for 2s. The shard returns to Aamon after a short delay, granting him the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Camouflage\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" state.\\n\\nIf the shard hits a non-minion enemy, it returns immediately.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"12.5s\",\"manaCost\":\"50\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_db82969869000375f7e6f1ab7ae895b3.png\",\"tags\":[\"Damage\"]},{\"name\":\"Endless Shards\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Aamon throws all shards at a designated enemy and slows them by 30% for 1.5s. After a short delay, the shards will fly to the enemy's location again, each dealing 35 (+10% Total Magic Power)-70 (+20% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage.\\n\\nThe number of shards increases with Aamon's armor charges and the shards on the ground (8-25).\\nThe damage dealt increases with the target's lost HP, to the max when the target's HP is below 30%.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Aamon throws all shards at a designated enemy and slows them by 30% for 1.5s. After a short delay, the shards will fly to the enemy's location again, each dealing 35\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+10% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"-70\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+20% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage.\\n\\nThe number of shards increases with Aamon's armor charges and the shards on the ground (8-25).\\nThe damage dealt increases with the target's lost HP, to the max when the target's HP is below 30%.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"50s\",\"manaCost\":\"150\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_2fe1e567c14d3bd648184285b7d9d427.png\",\"tags\":[\"Burst\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-1-2\"},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"rafaela\",\"heroName\":\"Rafaela\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Support heroes that can provide buffs such as Rafaela and Floryn.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"floryn\",\"heroName\":\"Floryn\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Support heroes that can provide buffs such as Rafaela and Floryn.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"Use 2nd Skill to Camouflage and flank the enemy. Deal damage with his 1st Skill and Basic Attacks, and Ultimate to take out backline heroes.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":10920,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_db82969869000375f7e6f1ab7ae895b3.png\"},{\"skillId\":10900,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"},{\"skillId\":10910,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_51b68183615922a3891919cd0a0d5536.png\"},{\"skillId\":10900,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"},{\"skillId\":10930,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_2fe1e567c14d3bd648184285b7d9d427.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"Use his skills and Enhanced Basic Attacks for very high jungling efficiency.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":10920,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_db82969869000375f7e6f1ab7ae895b3.png\"},{\"skillId\":10900,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"},{\"skillId\":10910,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_51b68183615922a3891919cd0a0d5536.png\"},{\"skillId\":10900,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Aamon build, counter, and strategy guide for MLBB jungle. Farm Genius Wand into Holy Crystal, beat reveal drafts, choose emblem setups, and close fights safely.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Aamon is a magic assassin whose real job starts after somebody else has damaged the target. His camouflage lets him choose the second entry, his shards punish runners, and his ultimate converts low health into a kill. Pick him when your team can start fights without him; lose with him when you ask him to start them.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"aamon\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-05-06\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"jungle-burst-default\",\"name\":\"Jungle Burst Default\",\"roleContext\":\"Jungle\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"arcane-boots\",\"name\":\"Arcane Boots\",\"cost\":690,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"genius-wand\",\"name\":\"Genius Wand\",\"cost\":2000,\"fixed\":false}