e Crest\",\"tier\":\"Common\",\"rawTier\":\"Common\",\"tag\":\"Elite\",\"tagSlug\":\"elite\",\"price\":\"599\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero1093-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/aamon/Hero1093-portrait-20220628175950.webp\",\"splashUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/aamon/Aamon-Noble-Crest-20230903014116.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Aamon/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Cyber Assassin\",\"tier\":\"Exceptional\",\"rawTier\":\"Exceptional\",\"tag\":\"Starlight\",\"tagSlug\":\"starlight\",\"price\":\"2023/01 StarLight Member\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero1094-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/aamon/Hero1094-portrait-20221216103151.webp\",\"splashUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/aamon/Aamon-Cyber-Assassin-20230825080854.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Aamon/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Vessel of Deceit\",\"tier\":\"Grand\",\"rawTier\":\"Grand\",\"tag\":\"Soul Vessels\",\"tagSlug\":\"soul-vessels\",\"price\":\"Limited-time Event\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero1095-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/aamon/Hero1095-portrait-20240619172936.webp\",\"splashUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/aamon/Aamon-Vessel-Of-Deceit-20251225192214.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Aamon/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Soul Reaver\",\"tier\":\"Exquisite\",\"rawTier\":\"Exquisite\",\"tag\":\"Collector\",\"tagSlug\":\"collector\",\"price\":\"Limited-time Event\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero1097-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/aamon/Hero1097-portrait-20260602040821.webp\",\"splashUrl\":null,\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Aamon/Cosmetics\"}],\"lore\":{\"backstory\":\"Aamon is the Duke of Castle Aberleen, the elder brother of Gusion and heir to the noble Paxley family's darkest secrets. Unlike his rebellious younger sibling, Aamon embraced the family's ancient traditions, mastering the art of invisible shards, crystalline daggers that phase in and out of visibility to strike from impossible angles. His calm, calculating demeanor masks a fierce devotion to his bloodline, and he views Gusion's departure from the family as both a personal betrayal and a wound upon the Paxley honor. Aamon now hunts in the shadows, his invisible blades ensuring that the Paxley name is both respected and feared across the Land of Dawn.\",\"allies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"gusion\",\"heroName\":\"Gusion\",\"relationship\":\"Younger brother and fellow Paxley heir, despite their estrangement\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"silvanna\",\"heroName\":\"Silvanna\",\"relationship\":\"Moniyan princess whose noble cause aligns with Paxley interests\"}],\"rivals\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"saber\",\"heroName\":\"Saber\",\"relationship\":\"Dimensional swordsman whose blade seeks to match his own\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"benedetta\",\"heroName\":\"Benedetta\",\"relationship\":\"Shadow ranger whose fencing style challenges his invisible shards\"}]},\"loreUrlName\":\"Aamon\",\"statsHistory\":[{\"date\":\"2026-09-07\",\"winRate\":50.58,\"pickRate\":0.74,\"banRate\":3.75},{\"date\":\"2026-09-10\",\"winRate\":50.67,\"pickRate\":0.73,\"banRate\":3.75},{\"date\":\"2026-09-16\",\"winRate\":50.61,\"pickRate\":0.72,\"banRate\":3.75},{\"date\":\"2026-09-28\",\"winRate\":49.72,\"pickRate\":0.69,\"banRate\":2.3},{\"date\":\"2026-10-02\",\"winRate\":49.62,\"pickRate\":0.69,\"banRate\":2.32},{\"date\":\"2026-10-09\",\"winRate\":49.59,\"pickRate\":0.66,\"banRate\":2.29},{\"date\":\"2026-10-17\",\"winRate\":50.13,\"pickRate\":0.59,\"banRate\":2.23}]},\"relatedHeroesSlot\":\"$L66\",\"statsSeoSlot\":\"$L67\",\"fieldManualSlot\":\"$L68\"}]\n62:[\"$\",\"$L69\",null,{\"heroName\":\"Aamon\",\"heroSlug\":\"aamon\",\"roles\":\"$61:props:hero:role\",\"lanes\":\"$61:props:hero:lane\",\"difficulty\":2,\"winRate\":50.13,\"pickRate\":0.59,\"banRate\":2.23,\"cu