\"]}]]}]}],\"$L7b\",\"$L7c\"]}]]}]\n68:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative content-lazy lg:grid lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_clamp(230px,24%,300px)] lg:gap-x-6 xl:gap-x-8 lg:items-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"lg:order-2 lg:sticky lg:self-start\",\"style\":{\"top\":128},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L7d\",null,{\"target\":\"#hero-article\"}]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"hero-article\",\"className\":\"relative lg:order-1 bg-[#0a0a0a]/85 backdrop-blur-sm border border-[#C8AA6E]/15 p-5 md:p-9 overflow-hidden\",\"style\":{\"boxShadow\":\"0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.03) inset, 0 18px 38px -24px rgba(0,0,0,0.8)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#F0D060]/55 to-transparent\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-[#F0D060]/40\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-[#C8AA6E]/30\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-[#C8AA6E]/30\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-[#C8AA6E]/30\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute -top-32 -right-24 w-72 h-72 rounded-full bg-[#C8AA6E]/[0.05] blur-3xl pointer-events-none\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative hero-article-body max-w-[860px] mx-auto\",\"children\":[[[[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-0\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Pick Aamon when the fight already has a crack\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Aamon belongs in jungle drafts that can create the first health advantage before he appears. He is correct with mid laners who poke or pin space from range: Xavier, Pharsa, Yve, Valentina, Cecilion, Lylia. He also likes roamers who either escort his second entry or make one target stand still long enough for the execute window: Mathilda, Angela, Tigreal, Atlas, Minotaur.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"The trap is drafting him as the only engage. Aamon can enter camouflage, reset his basic attack, and chase a damaged target, but none of that makes the enemy marksman spend Flicker at full HP. If your EXP, mid, and roam all need someone else to open the map, Aamon becomes a farmer watching fights happen outside his range.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Avoid him into stacked reveal and point-click lockdown. Rafaela, Natalia, Saber, Kaja, Franco, Khufra, and Ruby all attack the part of Aamon that matters: the short moment after camouflage breaks. One answer is playable. Two answers force him to spend the whole game waiting for a perfect angle that never arrives.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-3\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Patch 2.1.47 reduced his ultimate damage against high-HP targets and fixed shard-count issues. That nerf still shapes him today, so he is less convincing as a tank shredder than old clips suggest. Draft him to delete carries and wounded mages, not to solve Fredrinn, Hylos, or Gloo by himself.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-1\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[\"$L7e\",\"His whole kit is a delayed trigger\"]}],\"\\n\",\"$L7f\",\"\\n\",\"$L80\",\"\\n\",\"$L81\",\"\\n\",\"$L82\",\"\\n\",\"$L83\",\"\\n\",\"$L84\",\"\\n\",\"$L85\",\"\\n\",\"$L86\",\"\\n\",\"$L87\",\"\\n\",\"$L88\",\"\\n\",\"$L89\"],\"$L8a\",\"$L8b\"],\"$L8c\"]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"a3:I[392015,[\"$7\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$b\",\"$2e\",\"$3e\",\"$3f\"],\"default\"]\nb1:I[131354,[\"$7\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$b\",\"$2e\",\"$3e\",\"$3f\"],\"default\"]\n6d:[\"$\",\"$L6a\",\"paquito\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/paquito\",\"className\":\"group block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative bg-surface-4 border border-mlbb-gold/20 overflow-hidden card-hover hover:border-mlbb-gold/50\",\"style\":{\"boxShadow\":\"0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 p-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative w-14 h-14 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 bg-surface-3\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L6b\",null,{\"src\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5ab87805b9107b126a3bab64a8a199ad.png\",\"alt\":\"Paquito - The Heavenly Fist\",\"unoptimized\":false,\"priority\":\"$undefined\",\"fetchPriority\":\"$undefined\",\"fill\":true,\"className\":\"object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\",\"sizes\":\"56px\",\"placeholder\":\"blur\",\"blurDataURL\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMTAwIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwMCIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj48cmVjdCB3aWR0aD0iMTAwIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwMCIgZmlsbD0iIzBkMTIyNSIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-1 min-w-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h4\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading font-bold text-text-primary group-hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors truncate\",\"children\":\"Paquito\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-0.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\