":false,\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-text-accent hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankTierListLink\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Epic\"}}],\" →\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-muted text-[13px] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceLead\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Epic\",\"name\":\"Aamon\"}}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"50.10\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceMid1\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"Aamon\",\"delta\":\"-0.04%\"}}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"0.75\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceMid2\"}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"5.15\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceAfter\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Epic\"}}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"article\",\"legend\",{\"className\":\"group relative min-w-0 border border-mlbb-gold/15 bg-surface-1/40 p-3.5 pl-5 md:p-4 md:pl-6 transition-colors hover:border-mlbb-gold/30\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-[3px]\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"linear-gradient(to bottom, #4dc9f6, #4dc9f633)\",\"boxShadow\":\"0 0 12px -2px #4dc9f680\"}}],[\"$\",\"header\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-2 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-x-3 gap-y-1 flex-wrap\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-baseline gap-2.5 text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.06em]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-block rounded-sm px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] self-center\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#4dc9f6\",\"background\":\"#4dc9f61a\",\"border\":\"1px solid #4dc9f640\"},\"children\":\"Legend\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankCardH3\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"Aamon\",\"rank\":\"Legend\"}}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"href\":\"/tier-list?rank=legend\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-text-accent hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankTierListLink\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Legend\"}}],\" →\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-muted text-[13px] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceLead\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Legend\",\"name\":\"Aamon\"}}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"50.00\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceMid1\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"Aamon\",\"delta\":\"-0.14%\"}}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"0.72\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceMid2\"}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"3.49\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceAfter\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Legend\"}}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"article\",\"mythic\",{\"className\":\"group relative min-w-0 border border-mlbb-gold/15 bg-surface-1/40 p-3.5 pl-5 md:p-4 md:pl-6 transition-colors hover:border-mlbb-gold/30\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-[3px]\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"linear-gradient(to bottom, #f59e0b, #f59e0b33)\",\"boxShadow\":\"0 0 12px -2px #f59e0b80\"}}],\"$L9f\",\"$La0\"]}],\"$La1\",\"$La2\"]}]\n7e:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}]\n7f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-4\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Aamon works because camouflage is not just stealth. It is his reload system. Skill hits put him into camouflage, leaving camouflage enhances the next basic attack, and repeated enhanced attacks build the shards that make the final cast lethal.\"}]\n80:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-5\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"That means the correct combo is not \\\"press everything fast.\\\" It is damage, vanish, re-enter, count the target's escape tool, then spend the ultimate when the health bar is already low enough that the shards finish the job. The player who ults first usually gets a slow and a warning sign. The player who ults second gets the kill.\"}]\n81:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-6\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Skill 2 is the clearest example. If it hits a non-minion enemy, the shard returns immediately and gives the camouflage entry. If it misses, it still returns after a delay, which means the skill can be used as a fog tool before the fight. Throwing it into a bush or across a wall before showing is often stronger than throwing it directly at the target.\"}]\n82:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-2\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Jungle routing: the first four minutes\"]}]\n83:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-7\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Aamon's first four minutes are about clean economy, not proving hands. You are farming toward level 4, first Turtle position, and an early magic penetration purchase. Any detour must buy a real lane state.\"}]\n84:[\"$\",\"ol\",\"ol-0\",{\"className\":\"list-decimal list-inside text-[#9BA0B4] my-3 space-y-2 ml-2\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Open with damage, then use camouflage to stay healthy.\"}],\" Start on the buff that lines up with your gold-lane protection plan. Use Skill 1 to begin shard tempo, use Skill 2 for the camouflage cycle, and do not burn Retribution unless the camp is contested.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Do not chase the level-2 clip.\"}],\" Before ultimate, Aamon lacks the finishing button that makes his damage scary. If mid asks for a forced invade while your second camp is alive, clear first unless the enemy jungler is already trapped.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Spend the first Turtle setup on vision, not ego.\"}],\" Arrive through fog, hold Skill 2 until the enemy CC shows, and save Retribution for the objective. Aamon without jungle control is just a magic assassin with expensive item needs.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n85:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-8\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"The first successful gank should usually happen after the first full clear or after a lane burns Flicker. If the target still has dash, battle spell, and full HP, your time is better spent taking camps and making the next fight impossible for them.\"}]\n86:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-3\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"The spike is Genius Wand into Holy Crystal\"]}]\n87:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-9\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[\"The two-item window Aamon is farming toward is \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Genius Wand plus Holy Crystal\"}],\", usually around minutes 8 to 10 in an even jungle game. Genius Wand lowers magic defense through repeated damage, while Holy Crystal turns the magic-power total into a larger number. Together, they make one Soul Shards cycle plus enhanced basics threaten a backliner who has already been clipped by your team.\"]}]\n88:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-10\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Before that point, play like a patient tempo jungler. Take kills that are already offered, but do not trade your pathing for a low-percentage dive. After that point, the map changes: every mid wave, purple-buff entrance, and Lord-side bush can become a pick zone if your roam is near enough to cover the exit.\"}]\n89:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-11\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Feather of Heaven and Starlium Scythe are the alternate two-item conversation when the enemy draft gives you repeated enhanced-basic windows instead of clean burst windows. Feather rewards the camouflage-to-basic loop, and Starlium rewards the skill-into-basic rhythm with a true-damage proc. That setup is better when fights stretch. Genius into Holy is better when the target needs to disappear before their support can react.\"}]\n8a:[\"$\",\"$La3\",null,{\"slot\":\"7246933188\",\"variant\":\"in-article\",\"className\":\"my-8\"}]\n8b:[[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-0\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Stop diving first\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"The common wrong reflex is to see the enemy marksman, press Skill 2 forward, and trust camouflage to save the exit. That is how Aamon dies with ultimate still traveling. Camouflage chooses the angle; it does not cancel every punishment after you reveal.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ol\",\"ol-0\",{\"className\":\"list-decimal list-inside text-[#9BA0B4] my-3 space-y-2 ml-2\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Enter after the first hard CC is spent.\"}],\" If Franco, Kaja, Saber, or Khufra still has the button that stops you after camouflage, you are not flanking yet. You are waiting.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Ult the damaged carry, not the nearest body.\"}],\" A full-HP tank wastes the part of Endless Shards that scales with missing health. The better target is the mage or marksman leaving the fight after your mid laner already hit them.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Break camouflage outside hook and knockup range.\"}],\" Your first enhanced basic matters more than the first body you see. If revealing puts you inside Atlas, Ruby, or Khufra control, you have chosen the wrong entry square.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"There is one support-dependent exception. With Mathilda or Angela attached, Aamon can take a sharper second entry because the support can extend or rescue the play. With Tigreal, Atlas, or Franco, assume there is no rescue. They are starting the fight, and your job is to arrive after the enemy has already answered them.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-1\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Itemization is four locks and two arguments\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"The locked jungle baseline is Arcane Boots with a jungle blessing, Genius Wand, Holy Crystal, and Divine Glaive. Arcane Boots gives early magic penetration. Genius Wand rewards repeated shard hits. Holy Crystal raises the magic-power ceiling. Divine Glaive is the answer once frontliners buy real magic defense.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-3\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Choose the boot blessing by the job. Ice Retribution is the safest default because Aamon wants one more slow to keep a runner inside shard range. Flame Retribution is the snowball option when you are ahead and need the duel damage. Tough Boots with a jungle blessing is only for games where crowd control, not damage, is the reason you die.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-4\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"The fifth and sixth slots are the real draft read:\"}],\"\\n\",\"$La4\",\"\\n\",\"$La5\",\"\\n\",\"$La6\",\"\\n\",\"$La7\",\"\\n\",\"$La8\",\"\\n\",\"$La9\",\"\\n\",\"$Laa\",\"\\n\",\"$Lab\",\"\\n\",\"$Lac\",\"\\n\",\"$Lad\",\"\\n\",\"$Lae\",\"\\n\",\"$Laf\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb0\"]\n8c:[\"$\",\"$Lb1\",null,{\"heroName\":\"Aamon\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"8d:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative bg-surface-4 border borde