ip\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Against Saber or Kaja, wait until they show on another target or spend the lock button. Camouflage is not a cleanse, and Winter Crown only helps if you bought enough time to press it.\"]}]]]}]]}]\n"])</script></body></html>